PROVENANCE AND LICENSING OF THE FILES IN THIS DIRECTORY
=======================================================

The MATLAB/Octave sources in this folder (*.m) and the C filter source
(multisigfilter.c, plus the Linux-portable derivative multisigfilter_oct.c) are
taken from the FHR Morphological Analysis (FHRMA) Toolbox by Samuel Boudet
(samuel.boudet@gmail.com, Faculte de Medecine et Maieutique):

    https://github.com/utbm-vi/FHRMA   (and associated publications)
    Boudet S. et al., "Fetal heart rate baseline computation with a weighted
    median filter", Computers in Biology and Medicine, 2019.

LICENSE
